          "instruction": "Choose the correct letter, <strong>A</strong>, <strong>B</strong> or <strong>C</strong>.",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "Q21",
              "text": "The Antarctic Centre was established in Christchurch because",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "text": "New Zealand is a member of the Antarctic Treaty."
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "text": "Christchurch is geographically well positioned."
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "text": "the climate of Christchurch is suitable."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "Q22",
              "text": "One role of the Antarctic Centre is to",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "text": "provide expeditions with suitable equipment."
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "text": "provide researchers with financial assistance."
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "text": "ensure that research is internationally relevant."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "Q23",
              "text": "The purpose of the Visitors' Centre is to",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "text": "provide accommodation."
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "text": "run training sessions."
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "text": "show people what Antarctica is like."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "Q24",
              "text": "Dr Merrywhether says that Antarctica is",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "text": "unlike any other country."
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "text": "extremely beautiful."
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "text": "too cold for tourists."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "Q25",
              "text": "According to Dr Merrywhether, Antarctica is very cold because",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "text": "of the shape of the continent."
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "text": "it is surrounded by a frozen sea."
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "text": "it is an extremely dry continent."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "Q26",
              "text": "Dr Merrywhether thinks Antarctica was part of another continent because",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "text": "he has done his own research in the area."
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "text": "there is geological evidence of this."
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "text": "it is very close to South America."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
